WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:06.230
Recently, illegally downloading television shows over the internet has become common.

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:09.150
If you don't have the rights-holder's permission,

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:15.030
obtaining bootlegs via the internet or other means is prohibited by law.

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:17.240
Please take care.

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:19.330
...Can I touch you?

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:21.790
That's prohibited too.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:23.620
Damn.

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:27.590
Alright, brother, I'm leaving.

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:28.500
Yeah.

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:33.800
What do you think?

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:37.850
He seems normal when you talk to him, and he looks fine, but...

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:40.720
He's a bit different than usual.

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:41.470
Yeah.

00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:12.760
Didn't I say I'd be home late today?

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:15.090
I know you're lonely, but...

00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:19.550
<i>You there!</i>

00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:22.270
<i>You can see me?</i>

00:01:23.980 --> 00:01:24.890
Why?!

00:01:24.890 --> 00:01:27.480
Why aren't there others like him?!

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:32.190
Boring!

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:50.020
Kiseki wa genjitsu no tonari ni aru

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:50.020
Miracles are right beside reality

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:53.110
Kanarazu aru

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:53.110
They're there for sure

00:01:58.870 --> 00:02:04.460
Chiisana tameiki shinpai dakara

00:01:58.870 --> 00:02:04.460
I heave a tiny sigh because I'm worried

00:02:04.830 --> 00:02:10.370
Ushiro sugata mimamotteirunda yo

00:02:04.830 --> 00:02:10.370
From behind you, I'm watching over you

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:16.310
Kirai dattara konna koto iwanai yo

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:16.310
I wouldn't be saying this if I hated you

00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:22.490
Kitto hito wa hitori janai

00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:22.490
I know it must be true that no man is an island

00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:23.900
Hitori janai

00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:23.900
You're not alone

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:30.170
Tatoeba sotto yubisaki ni fureru omoi

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:30.170
For example, if you gently brush those hopes with your fingertips

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:36.110
Tatoeba taisetsu na toki wo wasurenaide

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:36.110
For example, if you never forget these precious times

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:42.050
Kakato wo motto sukoshi dake takaku agete

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:42.050
I'll boost you up, just a little higher

00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:48.030
Mieru yo ano ko no hitomi ni utsuru hikari

00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:48.030
Look and see the light reflecting in her eyes

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:53.900
ENERGY wa sekai no zenbu ni michiteru

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:53.900
Filling up the whole world with energy

00:02:54.210 --> 00:03:01.690
Ima dake wa chikara wo kashite ageru yo

00:02:54.210 --> 00:03:01.690
Just for now, I'll lend my strength to you

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:16.210
Discharge Girl?

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:19.380
Someone who can drain people's energy...

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:21.720
Is there really someone who can do that?

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:24.430
You can see the evidence.

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:31.560
I'm certain our superiors will discuss this with Captain Pulse and you'll be notified of it soon.

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:35.150
We encountered her in the area under your jurisdiction last night.

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:37.940
Then there's a chance we might meet her...

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:40.110
She's very dangerous.

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:44.160
Anyone who gets in her way is just risking their life.

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:49.040
If you see her, stay as far away as possible. Understood?

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:50.290
Yes.

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:54.170
But... I can't just ignore her!

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:56.590
I'll make her stop.

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:58.590
Plug, weren't you listening?

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:04.590
But if she's just left alone, more and more people will fall prey to her, becoming unlucky victims!

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:06.300
I can't allow that!

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:07.680
But even so...

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:12.390
Charging isn't just a job to you, is it?

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:19.320
I commend you for your morals but it's our job to capture her.

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:23.240
The Audit Division won't just let this incident slide.

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:28.240
A call to arms?

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:34.250
Beware! Electric Discharge Girl!

00:04:31.960 --> 00:04:34.250
Beware! Electric Discharge Girl!

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:40.920
The number of charging targets in our area has drastically increased.

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:44.880
As of now, everyone is being dispatched to charge people.

00:04:45.390 --> 00:04:46.970
A drastic increase?

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:48.180
Why?

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:51.640
The cause is said to be this girl.

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:55.940
But you must not make contact with her.

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:58.400
If you see her, report to me at once.

00:04:58.860 --> 00:04:59.610
That is all.

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:00.570
Yes, ma'am!

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:03.860
That girl is the discharge girl?

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:11.740
Everybody here?

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:14.290
Alright, communicator on!

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:17.960
What's going on?

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:19.170
There's tons of them!

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:20.590
W-What should we do?

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:21.880
The heck if I know!

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:23.420
Don't panic!

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:26.010
Everybody, charge the targets nearest to your position.

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:27.390
And Plug, Alesta.

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:27.970
Yes.

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:28.550
Yes.

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:32.100
Even if you're part of a team, you're to proceed on separately.

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:35.350
Head to your originally assigned sectors. Got it?

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:36.270
Roger.

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:40.820
Electrical Leakage Ladies?

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:42.070
I see...

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:46.490
It's the Audit Division's job to catch her.

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:49.820
Looks like there's no need for you to take the spotlight.

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:53.700
Yeah, I can focus on charging now.

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:56.160
Hang in there, everyone.

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:58.170
I'm coming to save you!

00:05:58.630 --> 00:06:00.670
Okay, everyone, let's do it!

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:01.840
Yeah!

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:17.480
As they say, it's time to reel in the big one.

00:06:18.650 --> 00:06:20.230
Here I go!

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:24.480
Charge!

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:26.780
That's five.

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:31.530
No...

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:35.870
Charging them... is not working.

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:38.830
Their depression levels aren't going down!

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:40.000
What's the meaning of this?

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:41.080
Calm down!

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:42.500
Charge them again.

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:43.130
Right!

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:44.090
Roger!

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:49.430
Charge!

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:53.180
His depression level didn't change.

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:56.100
Not enough yet...

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:57.390
Once more!

00:06:57.390 --> 00:07:00.940
How many times...

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:02.860
...do we need to charge them?

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:05.070
They need to recover already, damn it!

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:06.820
Take that!

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:11.700
What am I doing?

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:17.250
It took ten charges to work.

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:21.250
Is the discharge girl's special ability this powerful?

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:24.000
Can we keep up the pace?

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:42.440
W-What the?!

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:44.900
No, no! My skirt!

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:46.150
Now!

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:49.190
Charge!

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:54.370
Viva la Panties!

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:56.160
Yes!

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:58.120
Don't get excited!

00:07:58.700 --> 00:07:59.700
Taako?

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:01.160
What are you doing here?

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:03.830
This is the edge of my area.

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:05.670
More importantly, what the heck was that?

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:08.130
That's how I charge people.

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:10.550
First, I improve the mood of the target...

00:08:10.550 --> 00:08:12.760
Why are you wasting valuable time doing that?

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:15.600
Well, they're humans...

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:19.180
...you can't just treat them as things to charge, you have to consider their feelings...

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:21.310
Doing that kind of thing will take forever!

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:25.230
It's been confirmed that it takes ten charges to...

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:29.530
Viva la Panties!

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:31.740
No way!

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:33.400
Can you confirm that, Taako?

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:34.740
With one charge?

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:36.950
That's far better than doing it ten times?

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:46.170
I'll give it a shot.

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:50.710
Plug did that?

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:55.180
But come to think of it...

00:08:55.680 --> 00:09:00.930
<i>When I checked her data that time, there weren't any repeaters.</i>

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:05.650
<i>Everybody, myself included, are bound get some eventually, but...</i>

00:09:05.650 --> 00:09:09.520
<i>Plug managed to change the level with only one charge.</i>

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:12.650
<i>The difference between Plug and the rest of us...</i>

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:16.950
<i>...is how we treat our targets: as people, or as things.</i>

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:20.830
<i>If it is that difference that affects the overall condition of our charged targets...</i>

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:23.500
Amazing, Plug!

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:27.040
The depression level went back to a D with just one charge!

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:28.750
I've done it too!

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:29.880
It's a success!

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:31.920
Depression level dropped down to an E!

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:33.920
Operation Plug is amazing!

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:39.050
Operation Plug, huh?

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:40.100
Yeah, right.

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:44.850
Charge!

00:09:46.770 --> 00:09:47.940
Charge!

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:49.520
Oh, what luck!

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:59.530
People of Japan, how are you doing?

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:05.580
I'm doing well. I love Japan, and I love everyone in Japan.

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:06.960
It's now!

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:10.590
Charge!

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:15.420
I love you, too!

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:17.970
Alrighty!

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:19.890
Plug?

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:21.260
Yes, sorry!

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:23.640
Did you do something again?

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:26.680
No, nothing at all.

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:27.890
Well, forget it.

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:30.980
Anyway, Operation Plug's working well so far.

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:32.900
You've certainly saved the day!

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:35.990
Thank you...

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:38.110
Keep up the good work!

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:43.030
I was praised.

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:47.120
This is certainly a first for me even after working for so long.

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:53.250
I wonder if Alesta would be mad if she knew this was Sentou's idea.

00:10:59.340 --> 00:11:02.100
<i>Charge!</i>

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:07.850
Rather than waiting for it, wouldn't creating the right moment be easier?

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:12.480
I'm just doing what he did back then.

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:17.360
I'm coming!

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:19.360
<i>When I see him, I'll have to say,</i>

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:21.990
<i>"Thank you, Sentou!"</i>

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:29.330
H-Hold it!

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:33.080
I ran away because you're a big meanie.

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:40.220
People who try to stop what I do should bug off.

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:51.900
I think I'm done here...

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:56.440
Man, how many more do I have to charge?

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:59.150
I'm way over my normal quota!

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:01.360
I think it's time for a break.

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:05.200
Come to think of it, this is close to...

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:11.960
Sentou?

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:34.440
Fanservice!

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:40.440
Here's more!

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:48.870
I knew we shouldn't have split up.

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:50.290
We had no choice.

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:53.830
Division Two's area is too large for our numbers.

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:57.340
But we now know she's around here.

00:12:57.340 --> 00:13:01.010
Call everyone together and thoroughly search this area!

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:14.810
Geez, even the great Sentou needs to be charged, how ironic is that?

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:17.900
I've always thought of you as the gutsy character.

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:21.320
Sentou?

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:23.440
Earth to Sentou?

00:13:27.870 --> 00:13:31.160
Lookie, Sentou!

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:33.080
Hey!

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:34.580
At least say something!

00:13:38.540 --> 00:13:39.790
Sentou?

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:42.300
Can't you see me?

00:13:46.050 --> 00:13:47.680
Your cell...

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:53.680
Hello?

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:57.350
He can't even touch me now?

00:13:57.350 --> 00:13:58.980
Oh, Hakone!

00:13:58.980 --> 00:13:59.650
What's wrong?

00:14:01.900 --> 00:14:06.360
Oh, nothing. I just wanted to see what you were up to.

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:09.620
That's a strange thing to think about.

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:12.830
Don't be silly.

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:15.710
He looks okay, but...

00:14:15.710 --> 00:14:17.330
I'm the same as always.

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:20.540
His depression level is still B.

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:24.460
He's just trying to keep Hakone from worrying. Is he faking it?

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:26.800
There's a light in his eyes!

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:28.300
He's feeling a bit better!

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:31.640
I see. It's all because of Hakone.

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:32.680
This is my chance!

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:42.480
I'll charge you up and bring you back to your old self.

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:50.370
Oh, yeah. Anything you want for dinner?

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:50.370
Just hang in there, Sentou.

00:14:50.370 --> 00:14:51.780
Here I come.

00:14:51.780 --> 00:14:54.040
I finally found you.

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:59.120
<i>...this girl.</i>

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:02.290
You're...

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:06.420
Why?

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:07.720
See you!

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:10.220
What do you think you're looking at?

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:18.180
Be careful with your next move, or else...

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:20.020
You twerp, you ruined it!

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:21.860
That was my best chance!

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:24.230
What now?

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:26.360
The thing's all banged up.

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:29.400
Now I can't bring him back.

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:30.950
What do I do in this situation?

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:32.490
Hey!

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:33.990
I know!

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:35.830
Come in. Alesta!

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:38.580
I'm at Sentou's place.

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:38.580
I said, hey!

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:40.160
Sentou's house?

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:41.210
What are you doing there?

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:45.550
You can't go off and have all the fun... I mean, skip work!

00:15:45.550 --> 00:15:48.460
Whatever, just bring your refresher and come-

00:15:50.340 --> 00:15:51.300
Plug?

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:52.680
Respond.

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:55.100
Plug...

00:15:58.810 --> 00:16:01.690
Now my communicator too...

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:04.900
Why you!

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:08.650
If you charge it, will it be fine?

00:16:09.740 --> 00:16:12.570
Are you talking about Sentou?

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:14.570
Will it be able to see me again?

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:17.540
Yeah, if it's due to his depressed state...

00:16:17.540 --> 00:16:19.410
Then charge it.

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:22.870
But you broke this, duh!

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:26.590
And aren't you the one who did this to him in the first place?

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:28.760
But...

00:16:28.760 --> 00:16:32.130
But I never meant for this to happen!

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:35.180
<i>Who are you?</i>

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:36.680
<i>Are you with the charging ladies?</i>

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:40.930
It was the first of its kind to be able to see me,

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:43.060
so I decided to have fun with it...

00:16:43.730 --> 00:16:46.020
<i>Did you do that?</i>

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:47.770
<i>Yeah, so what?</i>

00:16:48.780 --> 00:16:49.900
<i>You...</i>

00:16:59.040 --> 00:17:04.250
It was lots of fun being chased, but I didn't know it could touch me.

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:12.380
I got startled and...

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:25.020
<i>I broke it...</i>

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:35.200
Man, what have I been doing?

00:17:35.910 --> 00:17:37.370
Whatever.

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:56.510
Do you regret what you did?

00:17:56.510 --> 00:17:58.970
Yeah, because...

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:00.970
Because?

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:03.680
It was such a fun toy.

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:06.980
What did you say?

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:12.230
I'm saying it's not like all the other toys. It's special.

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:21.700
With the others, when I use my power a little, they get worn out right away after being so lively.

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:24.080
It was fun to watch.

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:26.080
But...

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:27.500
Boring!

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:32.000
Then, people are toys to you?

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:33.630
Yeah, that's right.

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:34.960
That's wrong!

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:37.720
You can't just take their energy like that!

00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:40.430
You can't treat them like things.

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:42.180
That's wrong!

00:18:42.930 --> 00:18:46.850
People... Humans aren't toys!

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:51.690
But no one can see me in this world.

00:18:51.690 --> 00:18:54.780
No one will play with me!

00:18:58.360 --> 00:19:00.870
That's as far as you go, discharge girl!

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:04.620
Hey, wait!

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:12.340
Now, be a good girl and come with us.

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:16.260
Wait.

00:19:16.260 --> 00:19:18.300
You crones are really annoying!

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:24.850
Don't let her escape!

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:25.770
Roger that!

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:44.490
I haven't been able to get any word from her. What's going on?

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:47.660
That's...?

00:20:02.890 --> 00:20:04.640
That girl...

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:07.430
Plug!

00:20:07.430 --> 00:20:08.770
Alesta.

00:20:08.770 --> 00:20:11.480
Just now, I saw the Leakage Ladies-

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:14.560
Sentou?

00:20:14.560 --> 00:20:15.900
You see...

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:19.110
How could this be?!

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:22.490
Sentou is at depression level B! Why?

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:24.120
Please hear me out, it's actually...

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:25.830
Sentou!

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:31.460
Why is this...

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:33.170
Sentou!

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:35.210
Sentou, can you hear me?

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:37.460
What happened to you?!

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:38.460
Sentou!

00:20:41.470 --> 00:20:43.840
Milly, this is the end for you.

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:45.140
I won't lose.

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:47.060
Don't underestimate my bitch!

00:20:47.060 --> 00:20:48.350
Bring it!

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:49.430
It's the final battle!

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:50.930
Mistress Silica, go for it!

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:54.400
But first, a commercial!

00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:56.770
The food today was delicious again!

00:20:58.610 --> 00:21:01.570
Please answer me, Sentou!

00:21:01.570 --> 00:21:03.110
Sentou!

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:06.620
Yes?

00:21:06.620 --> 00:21:08.830
I haven't been able to contact Plug for a while now!

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:10.410
Do you know what's going on?

00:21:10.410 --> 00:21:12.620
If you're done, come lend us a hand.

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:13.540
There's no end to this!

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:14.870
Same here.

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:16.420
I'm so tired already...

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:17.540
Stop your whining!

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:21.010
There are still a lot of people out there who need our help!

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:22.170
Right...

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:23.380
Roger!

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:24.380
<i>That's right.</i>

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:27.140
<i>What I should do now is...</i>

00:21:30.560 --> 00:21:32.640
Alesta, calm down.

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:33.730
Alesta.

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:39.230
I'm counting on you to take care of Sentou, alright?

00:21:45.110 --> 00:21:48.910
<i>If he could see me, Sentou would definitely say this:</i>

00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:54.370
<i>"What's your job? It's to make people feel better, right?"</i>

00:22:00.590 --> 00:22:02.170
Plug, where are you going?

00:22:04.880 --> 00:22:10.010
My refresher is broken, so I'm going back to Life Core to get a new one.

00:22:12.720 --> 00:22:13.770
Plug...

00:22:16.560 --> 00:22:20.860
<i>In this city, there are still lots of people that she's made into her toys.</i>

00:22:20.860 --> 00:22:24.320
<i>I need to get to them as soon as I can!</i>

00:22:25.030 --> 00:22:27.530
<i>That's my...</i>

00:22:27.530 --> 00:22:29.740
<i>That's my job as a charging lady!</i>

00:22:36.330 --> 00:22:39.790
Honto wa totemo TOUGH nan da yo

00:22:36.330 --> 00:22:39.790
Really, I'm quite tough, you know

00:22:39.790 --> 00:22:42.590
Hitori demo heiki de

00:22:39.790 --> 00:22:42.590
I'm fine even all by myself

00:22:42.590 --> 00:22:45.380
Doko ni demo ikeru no

00:22:42.590 --> 00:22:45.380
I can go anywhere at all

00:22:45.380 --> 00:22:48.130
Koibito nante iranai

00:22:45.380 --> 00:22:48.130
I don't need a boyfriend or anything

00:22:48.130 --> 00:22:53.640
Takumashiku ikiteikunda to kimetetanda

00:22:48.130 --> 00:22:53.640
I decided that I would live strong

00:22:53.640 --> 00:22:55.390
Kimi to deau made wa

00:22:53.640 --> 00:22:55.390
Until the day I could meet you

00:23:00.650 --> 00:23:03.400
Sore wa arigachi na

00:23:00.650 --> 00:23:03.400
"That really is

00:23:03.400 --> 00:23:06.190
Warui kuse da yo

00:23:03.400 --> 00:23:06.190
It's a bad habit

00:23:06.190 --> 00:23:08.950
Hanashi janai ka? nante

00:23:06.190 --> 00:23:08.950
such an often-heard saying, right?"

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:11.740
Toshiue buranaide ne

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:11.740
Don't pretend to be older than you are

00:23:11.740 --> 00:23:16.910
Datte ne watashi wa itsumo tokubetsu

00:23:11.740 --> 00:23:16.910
But you know, I'm always an exceptional case

00:23:17.290 --> 00:23:20.040
Kimi ni mo kitto SPECIAL deshou

00:23:17.290 --> 00:23:20.040
I'm sure I'm special to you, too

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:21.790
Sore de nakya iya

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:21.790
I couldn't stand it any other way

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:25.590
Zettai watashi soba ni iru yo

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:25.590
I'll definitely always be beside you

00:23:25.590 --> 00:23:33.640
Kimi ga ochikondara namida fusegu kasa ni naritainda yo

00:23:25.590 --> 00:23:29.720
I want to become the umbrella

00:23:29.720 --> 00:23:33.640
that shields you from tears when you're feeling down

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:39.190
Keredo mamoreteru no wa naze ka watashi bakari

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:36.560
But why is it that I'm the one

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:39.190
who always ends up being protected?

00:23:39.520 --> 00:23:45.480
Kimochi no naka no koishi ne tsumazuite korobisou na toki

00:23:39.520 --> 00:23:45.480
At the times when, in my heart, I stumble and seem about to fall

00:23:45.690 --> 00:23:50.240
Itsumo sotto sasaete kureru

00:23:45.690 --> 00:23:50.240
Keep supporting me just a little, always

00:23:50.570 --> 00:23:54.740
Futoshita kizuna itoshii yo

00:23:50.570 --> 00:23:54.740
I'll treasure this unexpected bond

00:23:54.740 --> 00:23:56.080
Itsumademo

00:23:54.740 --> 00:23:56.080
Now and forever

00:23:56.450 --> 00:24:00.290
Eien Sweetheart

00:23:56.450 --> 00:24:00.290
Eternally, Sweetheart

00:24:05.750 --> 00:24:09.130
Sentou Oumi's life energy was stolen by the mysterious girl, Rona!

00:24:09.130 --> 00:24:10.510
What will be his fate?

00:24:10.510 --> 00:24:12.680
In this situation, I'll use the power of my love!

00:24:12.680 --> 00:24:15.310
Sentou, I'll do all sorts of good things, so get better!

00:24:15.310 --> 00:24:16.470
I can do it, too!

00:24:16.470 --> 00:24:19.930
Sentou, I'll make you feel better with my power of love...

00:24:21.060 --> 00:24:23.350
That's not really "the power of love."

00:24:23.350 --> 00:24:25.690
On the final episode of Fight In one Strike! Charging Ladies!!:

00:24:25.690 --> 00:24:26.230
Fight!

00:24:26.230 --> 00:24:27.110
In one strike!!

00:24:26.900 --> 00:24:34.120
Fight! In one strike!

00:24:27.110 --> 00:24:28.360
We're finally at the climax.

00:24:28.360 --> 00:24:30.200
Let's have a word from our two stars!

00:24:30.200 --> 00:24:31.400
Sentou...

00:24:31.400 --> 00:24:32.950
You're still saying that at the end?
